1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,967
（主题曲响起）
(THEME SONG PLAYING)

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,867
克拉克森：
今晚，到底谁更快？
雷诺还是自行车？
CLARKSON:
Tonight, which is faster?
A Renault or a bicycle?

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,633
艾伦·麦克阿瑟在我们的赛道上
扬帆起航。
Ellen MacArthur sets sail
on our track.

4
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:16,567
还有，花一万英镑
究竟能买到什么样的超跑？
And how much supercar
do you get for £10,000?

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,300
大家好。上周节目里
我们迎来了一辆
帕加尼风之子。
Hello. Now last week on
the show, we had
a Pagani Zonda.

6
00:00:25,333 --> 00:00:29,233
而这周，我们直接开门见山，
再上一辆！
And this week, we're kicking
off with another one!

7
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:35,500
哈蒙德：就是它了。
它叫风之子F。
HAMMOND: This is it.
It's called the Zonda F.

8
00:00:36,833 --> 00:00:40,667
从车头到车尾，几乎整个车身
都重新做过造型，
Nearly the whole body from
nose to tail has been restyled

9
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,667
全都拜进风洞
吹了一圈所赐。
following a visit
to the wind tunnel.

10
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:47,667
不仅如此，内饰变得
更加丧心病狂了。
On top of that, the interior
is now even more insane.

11
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,133
轮毂是镁合金的，
整套排气系统
The wheels are magnesium
and the whole exhaust system

12
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:54,567
更是用纯钛锻造出来的。
has been forged from titanium.

13
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,467
这辆F的身价
高达四十四万英镑，
The price for the F
is £440,000,

14
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,200
比普通版风之子
整整贵了十万镑。
£100,000 more than
the normal Zonda.

15
00:01:02,933 --> 00:01:06,200
所以，你最好祈祷这些改动
不只是做做表面功夫。
So, you'd hope the changes
aren't just cosmetic.

16
00:01:06,233 --> 00:01:08,333
事实证明，确实不是。
And indeed, they aren't.

17
00:01:09,567 --> 00:01:10,833
我的天呐！
Dear God!

18
00:01:14,033 --> 00:01:18,467
马力已经从原来的555匹制动马力
The power has gone up
from 555 brake horsepower

19
00:01:18,467 --> 00:01:21,200
飙升到了602匹。
to 602.

20
00:01:21,233 --> 00:01:27,300
那可是相当于两台保时捷卡曼的马力，
塞进了一辆比一台卡曼
还要轻的车里！
That is two Porsche Caymans,
in a car that weighs less than
one Porsche Cayman.

21
00:01:29,467 --> 00:01:33,067
零百加速，3.6秒。
Naught to 60, 3.6 seconds.

22
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:36,900
极速，时速215英里，
甚至可能更快。
Top speed, 215 mph,
maybe more.

23
00:01:38,533 --> 00:01:41,500
但这台F可绝不仅仅是
多了一把蛮力。
But the F isn't
merely about extra grunt.

24
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:44,967
真正的魔鬼全在细节里。
God really is in the details.

25
00:01:46,333 --> 00:01:49,833
刹车是碳陶材质的。
The brakes are carbon ceramic.

26
00:01:49,867 --> 00:01:53,900
甚至连车身骨架里
那些你看不见的碳纤维，
Even the carbon fibre in the
structure of the car that
you can't see,

27
00:01:53,933 --> 00:01:58,300
他们都改良了编织方式，
让它变得更轻、更坚固。
they've changed the
weave to make it
lighter and stronger.

28
00:02:02,367 --> 00:02:06,033
这真是力量与精准度
一种不可思议的结合。
It's such a bizarre mixture
of power and precision.

29
00:02:06,067 --> 00:02:10,300
要是外科医生用电锯做手术，
拿出来的肯定就是这玩意儿！
If surgeons used chainsaws,
this is what they'd have!

30
00:02:12,467 --> 00:02:16,533
把这一切糅合在一起，
带来的体验简直震颤灵魂。
Put it all together and the
experience is shattering.

31
00:02:20,367 --> 00:02:24,000
听听这声浪！听听啊！
The noise! Listen to that!

32
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:28,833
我浑身的汗毛
全都竖起来了！
All of the hair on my body
is standing up!

33
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:39,167
（大笑）我刚才本来想憋出几句
聪明绝顶的妙语，但我脑子完全空了！
(LAUGHING) I had tried to
think of clever things to
say then, but I couldn't!

34
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:42,367
太顶了……
我得再来一次！
It's just...
I'm gonna do that again!

35
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,033
（现场观众鼓掌欢呼）
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

36
00:02:47,067 --> 00:02:48,933
哈蒙德：哇哦！
HAMMOND: Wow!

37
00:02:48,967 --> 00:02:51,567
简直让人难以置信，
那辆车！
That is unbelievable,
that car!

38
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:54,533
太神了。我爱死它了！
It's brilliant. I love it!

39
00:02:54,567 --> 00:02:59,667
而且，就像我说的……
就像我说过的那样，
And, like I said...
Like I said,

40
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:02,933
它最绝的
就是把精准与力量
完美融为了一体。
it really is about that
combination of just
precision and power.

41
00:03:02,967 --> 00:03:06,633
这就像按下一块做工精良的腕表上的按钮
然后……
It's like pressing the button
on a beautifully crafted watch
and then

42
00:03:06,667 --> 00:03:10,267
（哔——）全世界的火山
全都喷发了！
简直太惊人了！
(BEEP) all the volcanoes
in the world erupt!
It's astonishing!

43
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:13,933
不过说正经的，
现在我们得去看看它在我们的赛道上
到底能跑多快了。
No, the thing is though,
we've now got to find out how
fast it goes round our track.

44
00:03:13,967 --> 00:03:17,733
这就意味着，得把它交给我们
圈养的赛车手了。
So that means handing it over
to our tame racing driver.

45
00:03:17,767 --> 00:03:20,800
-有人说，
他的眼泪是强力胶……
-（观众笑声）
-Some say that
his tears are adhesive...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

46
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:25,467
……还有人说如果他着了火，
能连着烧上一千天。
...and that if he caught fire,
he'd burn for 1,000 days.

47
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:32,033
我们只知道，
他叫斯提格（The Stig）。
All we know is
he's called The Stig.

48
00:03:32,067 --> 00:03:35,867
克拉克森：起步了！
我得说，这辆车
非常有希望
CLARKSON: And he's off!
I should say this car
has a very real chance

49
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:38,133
打破我们赛道
有史以来的最快圈速纪录。
of being the fastest car ever
round our track.

50
00:03:38,167 --> 00:03:43,033
这意味着它得干掉玛莎拉蒂MC12，
那家伙可比它
多了整整21匹马力。
That means beating the
Maserati MC 12 that has
21 more horsepower.

51
00:03:43,067 --> 00:03:48,900
过第一个弯，波澜不惊。
正温柔地唤醒那台狂暴的
梅赛德斯V12引擎。
First corner, no drama here.
Gently stoking up that massive
Mercedes V12.

52
00:03:48,933 --> 00:03:51,733
（古典乐播放中）
(CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYING)

53
00:03:51,767 --> 00:03:53,567
斯提格当然是完全不听引擎轰鸣的。
Stig of course, not listening
to the engine.

54
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,600
他正在里头陶醉于普赛尔的曲子呢。
这编曲，真不赖！
He's enjoying a spot
of Purcell, there.
Nice arrangement!

55
00:03:56,633 --> 00:03:59,767
进芝加哥弯，稳住节奏，
精细控制动力输出，
Chicago, carrying the pacing,
metering out the power,

56
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:02,667
用尽赛道宽度，一路狂飙，
直奔锤头弯（Hammerhead）。
using all the track and on his
way down to Hammerhead.

57
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,733
重刹之下车尾有点骚动了。小心！
Looking a little frisky under
braking. Careful!

58
00:04:04,767 --> 00:04:09,467
入弯千万小心。
别推头，千万别推头。
给油，现在加速冲！
Careful on the way in.
Don't let the nose run wide.
Go on, accelerate now!

59
00:04:09,467 --> 00:04:12,467
车屁股往外滑了一下，
但他瞬间就把它驯服了！
Tail steps out a bit but
he's on top of that in
an instant!

60
00:04:12,467 --> 00:04:14,700
（古典乐继续播放）
(CLASSICAL MUSIC CONTINUES)

61
00:04:16,467 --> 00:04:20,200
来到直道后的全速弯（Follow-through）。
这儿他肯定得收点油吧。
Here comes the follow-through.
Surely he'll have to lift off.

62
00:04:20,233 --> 00:04:24,567
没错，轻点油门，
然后贴着轮胎墙全油门出弯！
Yep, feathering the throttle
then back on it through
the tyres!

63
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:27,067
（笑声）
现在只剩下最后两个弯了。
(LAUGHING)
Now just two corners left.

64
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:31,467
它能干掉MC12吗？
能干掉那台本质上就是
男扮女装的恩佐（Enzo）吗？
Can it beat the MC 12?
Can it beat what is
basically an Enzo in drag?

65
00:04:31,467 --> 00:04:34,667
逼近甘邦弯（Gambon）。
圈速纪录近在眼前！
Coming up to Gambon.
Lap record is in sight!

66
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:37,733
甩尾出弯，
冲线！
Tail kicking out,
and across the line!

67
00:04:37,767 --> 00:04:42,767
好了。它要超越的目标是
玛莎拉蒂MC12的1分18秒9。
Right. It's got the
Maserati MC12 to beat, 1.18.9.

68
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:48,033
-它做到了！1分18秒4！
有史以来最快的圈速……
-（观众鼓掌欢呼）
-It's done it! 1.18.4!
Quickest score ever...
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

69
00:04:48,067 --> 00:04:50,567
……刷新了Top Gear
测试赛道的纪录！
...round the Top Gear
test track.

70
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,900
-我就知道！
-看样子你挺喜欢它的嘛？
-I knew it!
-You liked it, though did you?

71
00:04:52,933 --> 00:04:54,700
噢，天呐。
我就知道它能办到。
Oh, man.
I knew it would do that.

72
00:04:56,533 --> 00:04:57,867
这车简直绝了。
That is such a car.

73
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:00,000
真是不可思议的神车。
What an unbelievable car.

74
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:06,720
那么，呃，通常到了节目的这个环节，
我们仨本该插科打诨、聊聊
Now um, normally at this stage of the
program, we'd all fool around looking

75
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:09,440
本周的各种车圈新闻。
但很遗憾，显而易见，这周
at various news stories from the week.
But I'm afraid this week, obviously,

76
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:14,860
对我们所有人而言，整个焦点
完全被理查德·伯恩斯（Richard Burns）的不幸逝世所笼罩了。
the news has been completely dominated
as far as we're concerned, by the sad death
of Richard Burns.

77
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:19,580
他是英格兰有史以来唯一的WRC世界拉力赛冠军，
在与病魔进行了极其痛苦而漫长的
He was England's only ever World Rally
Champion, and he died after a horribly

78
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:25,600
抗争之后离世，年仅34岁。
因此我们特意为他制作了一段小小的致敬短片。
long illness, aged just 34. So we've
put together a little tribute for him.

79
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:28,620
♪ 大卫·鲍伊 - 《英雄》（Heroes） ♪
♪ David Bowie - Heroes ♪

80
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
[掌声]
[APPLAUSE]

81
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,000
他确实是，他真的是个
极其出色的车手，那个男人。
He was, he really was,
just a brilliant driver, that man.

82
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:47,620
话虽如此，但我以前住得离理查德挺近的，他经常顺道过来，
Well you say that, but I used to live quite
close to Richard, and he'd often pop round

83
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:53,640
在我家跟我儿子一起玩世嘉拉力街机，我儿子那时候才7岁。
to play these Sega Rally machines at home
with my son, who was 7 at the time.

84
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:57,360
结果他一次都没赢过我儿子。他总是不服：“我还要跟他再来一局……”
And he could never beat my son. He'd always
go "I'm gonna play him again..."

85
00:06:57,380 --> 00:07:00,380
然后到了晚上要走的时候，他就嘴硬：“我是故意让他赢的。”
Then he'd come off at the end
of the evening and go "I let him win."

86
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:04,400
[观众笑声]
他人真的太好了，我非常想念他。真的很想他。
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]
Just such a nice guy and I miss him. Badly.

87
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:06,420
很遗憾，我们现在得继续节目了。呃……
Sadly, we've gotta move on now. Umm...

88
00:07:07,233 --> 00:07:10,333
话说，要是你翻翻
汽车杂志后面的
分类小广告，
Yeah, if you go through
the small ads in the
back of car magazines

89
00:07:10,367 --> 00:07:14,900
你就会发现里面塞满了
各种超跑广告，
而且价格比什么还便宜？
you'll find they're stuffed
full of ads for supercars
which cost less than what?

90
00:07:14,933 --> 00:07:16,667
比一辆开了两年的蒙迪欧还便宜。
A two year old Mondeo.

91
00:07:16,667 --> 00:07:19,533
这听上去确实
诱人得要命，
但开这种车过日子，
Now this sounds
incredibly tempting,
but what are cars like this

92
00:07:19,567 --> 00:07:21,933
到底会是种什么体验？
going to be like to live with?

93
00:07:21,967 --> 00:07:24,933
为了找出答案，我们每人
领到了一万英镑，
So to find out, we were each
given £10,000

94
00:07:24,967 --> 00:07:29,967
任务是去买一辆
中置引擎的意大利超跑。
and told to go out and
buy a supercar that's
mid-engined and Italian.

95
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:33,067
没错，然后我们被要求
把各自买来的车
Yes, and then we were told
to take whatever we bought

96
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:36,267
开到布里斯托，
在那里迎接
一系列的挑战。
to Bristol,
where we would be
set a series of challenges.

97
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:41,100
-（笑声）
-我想你们大概已经能猜到
接下来会是什么下场了。
-(LAUGHING)
-I think you can probably see
where this is going.

98
00:07:41,133 --> 00:07:42,567
来看看当时的情况。
Here's what happened.

99
00:07:46,133 --> 00:07:48,667
哈蒙德：
我是第一个到的。
HAMMOND:
I was the first to arrive.

100
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:52,667
我只花了一万块
就买到了一辆法拉利！
I've just bought
a Ferrari for 10 grand!

101
00:07:52,667 --> 00:07:56,267
这是一辆1979年的308 GT4。
It's a 1979 308 GT4.

102
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:59,100
瞧瞧，黄色的，
中置引擎，该有的全都有。
Look, it's yellow,
it's got an engine in the
middle, it's got everything.

103
00:07:59,133 --> 00:08:03,000
好了。等另外两个家伙，
