Right. Wait for the others.
See what they've got.

104
00:08:06,667 --> 00:08:08,833
接下来开过来的是杰里米。
Jeremy was next to roll up.

105
00:08:10,667 --> 00:08:13,933
-克拉克森：瞻仰一下吧，
玛莎拉蒂Merak！
-哈？是玛莎拉蒂啊。
-CLARKSON: Behold
the Maserati Merak.
-Yeah? It's a Maserati.

106
00:08:13,967 --> 00:08:15,067
玛莎拉蒂Merak。
Maserati Merak.

107
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,667
Merak。
Merak.

108
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:20,100
-行吧！
-对吧！这搞不好是有史以来
最漂亮的超跑了。
-Right!
-Yup! Possibly the prettiest
supercar ever made.

109
00:08:20,133 --> 00:08:22,000
哈蒙德：可能吧……
HAMMOND: Potentially...

110
00:08:22,033 --> 00:08:25,267
-克拉克森：七千英镑。
-那比我便宜了
差不多三千块。
-CLARKSON: £7,000.
-That's about three
grand less than me.

111
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:26,367
克拉克森：那你买的是……
CLARKSON: And you bought a...

112
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,433
哈蒙德：我买的是法拉利。
HAMMOND: I've got a Ferrari.

113
00:08:27,467 --> 00:08:29,433
它就是法拉利！
才怪，你买的才不是。
It is a Ferrari!
No, you haven't.

114
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:31,467
这玩意儿压根就不是法拉利。
It just isn't a Ferrari.

115
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:34,867
克拉克森：理查德买的这辆车，
当年刚造出来时压根就不叫法拉利。
CLARKSON: What Richard
had bought was never
originally called a Ferrari.

116
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:39,000
它又慢又弱鸡，
其实原本叫迪诺（Dino）。
It was so slow and wet,
it was actually called a Dino.

117
00:08:39,033 --> 00:08:42,667
这就好比你非要显摆：
“我的衬衫是在George买的”，
得了吧，还不就是阿斯达超市货。
There's no point going,
"I bought my shirt at George,"
it's from ASDA.

118
00:08:42,667 --> 00:08:44,767
你买的就是辆超市平价车。
You've got a George car.

119
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:47,667
（大笑）
这什么鬼？
(LAUGHING)
What's this?

120
00:08:47,667 --> 00:08:50,800
-备胎啊！
-等等，这车是V6引擎，
对吧？
-It's a spare wheel!
-Hang on, they're a V6,
aren't they?

121
00:08:50,833 --> 00:08:52,700
是啊，但这车棒极了。
Yeah, but it's brilliant.

122
00:08:52,733 --> 00:08:56,667
就这发动机，
卖我车那哥们儿
The engine in this,
the guy I bought it from

123
00:08:56,667 --> 00:09:00,000
刚花了一万英镑
重做了整台发动机。
just spent £10,000
